            "reviewBody": "Yummy. My husband and I have this on birthdays and Christmas. It's very good, with a nice tang from the raspberry concentrate and sweetness from the ice cream. I couldn't find any raspberry cream soda, so I just used regular cream soda, which happened to be coloured red."
