              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Rae"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Family loved this. I halved the recipe. I did have to change the soda I couldn't find raspberry cream soda so I used plain cream soda. Since I was going to be missing the extra flavor I pureed 12oz of raspberries with softened ice cream and the juice concentrate before I added it to the soda. I think the pureeing with the ice cream helped it mix with the soda a lot better than just dumping the ice cream into the soda/juice mix.",
